---
// Marginalia Atlas component: an accessible local-only demonstration, explicitly not a production tokenizer.
---
<section class="interactive" aria-labelledby="tokenizer-title">
  <span class="eyebrow">Interactive / illustrative</span>
  <h3 id="tokenizer-title">Tokenizer explorer</h3>
  <p>短い文字列を、教育用の単純な区切り規則で分けます。これは実際の model tokenizer ではありません。</p>
  <label for="token-input">試す文字列</label>
  <input class="search-input" id="token-input" value="私は猫が好き" maxlength="48" />
  <div class="token-list" id="token-output" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <p class="answer" id="token-note">token は単語と一致するとは限りません。この表示は「分割と ID が別の処理である」ことだけを示します。</p>
</section>
<script>
  const input = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#token-input");
  const output = document.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>("#token-output");
  if (input && output) {
    const render = () => {
      const chunks: string[] = input.value.match(/[A-Za-z]+|[0-9]+|[^\s]/gu) || ["∅"];
      output.innerHTML = chunks.map((token: string, index: number) => `<span class="token">${index}: ${token.replaceAll("<", "&lt;")}</span>`).join("");
    };
    input.addEventListener("input", render);
    render();
  }
</script>
